    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Xung quanh linh kh\xED c\u1EE7a thi\xEAn \u0111\u1ECBa \u0111\u1ED9t nhi\xEAn
    b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u tr\xE0n v\xE0o trong c\u01A1 th\u1EC3 c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u01A1i,
    ng\u01B0\u01A1i c\u1EA3m th\u1EA5y th\u1EC3 n\u1ED9i ch\xE2n nguy\xEAn gi\u1ED1ng
    nh\u01B0 s\xF4i tr\xE0o n\u01B0\u1EDBc s\xF4i, c\u1EA5p t\u1ED1c l\u01B0u \u0111\u1ED9ng.
    Linh kh\xED ba \u0111\u1ED9ng k\xE9o d\xE0i t\u1EDBi t\u1EADn m\u1ED9t canh gi\u1EDD
    m\u1EDBi b\xECnh \u1ED5n l\u1EA1i, ng\u01B0\u01A1i r\u1ED1t c\u1EE5c x\xF4ng
    ph\xE1 b\xECnh c\u1EA3nh, c\u1EA3nh gi\u1EDBi theo \u0111\xF3 m\xE0 t\u0103ng
    l\xEAn"
